 "name_en": "Provisioning of Overdue Receivables (2PD)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Provisioning of Overdue Receivables (2PD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio230f5030ab2d4eeeadcd5141e5e24263\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio230f5030ab2d4eeeadcd5141e5e24263__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Due to the new impairment model of IFRS 9, Expected Credit Losses (ECL) on Trade Receivables are calculated using a provision matrix, where fixed provision rates apply depending on the number of days that trade receivable is outstanding. For the calculation of the provisioned amounts, you can periodically perform a valuation run to calculate the bad debt expense posting for overdue items. If you agree with the proposal of the valuation run, you can transfer the valuation to the general ledger to generate the postings. The system makes the adjustment posting for the relevant key date and reversal postings for the date after the key date.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio230f5030ab2d4eeeadcd5141e5e24263__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain customer specific provision matrix via SSCUI</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use a valuation program for the flat-rate value adjustment that works like the payment and dunning run</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Define each valuation run explicitly through the execution day and an identification</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Specify the execution type of the valuation by defining various parameters</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve efficiency through reuse of parameters from existing valuation runs</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze defined accounts through the valuation run and create valuations in a proposal run</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create the posting in G/L accounting during the transfer and save the valuations for each line item</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Make reversal postings for the day after the relevant key day</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio230f5030ab2d4eeeadcd5141e5e24263__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Meet the legal requirements</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate the valuation process of trade receivables and reduce cost by less manual effort</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>逾期应收账款准备金 (2PD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio230f5030ab2d4eeeadcd5141e5e24263\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio230f5030ab2d4eeeadcd5141e5e24263__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">由于 IFRS 9 的新减值模型，使用准备金矩阵计算贸易应收账款的预期信用损失 (ECL)，其中根据贸易应收账款未清天数应用固定准备金率。对于准备金金额的计算，您可以定期执行评估运行以计算逾期项目的坏账费用过账。如果您同意评估运行的建议，则可以将评估传输到总账以生成过账。系统在相关关键日期进行调整过账，并在关键日期之后的日期进行冲销过账。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio230f5030ab2d4eeeadcd5141e5e24263__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过 SSCUI 维护客户特定配置矩阵</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将评估程序用于统一费率价值调整，类似于付款和催款运行</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过执行日和标识，明确定义每个评估运行</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过定义各种参数，指定评估的执行类型</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过重用现有评估运行中的参数，提高效率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过评估运行分析定义的科目，并在建议运行中创建评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在传输期间在总账会计中创建过账，并保存每个行项目的评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在相关关键日期的第二天进行冲销过账。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio230f5030ab2d4eeeadcd5141e5e24263__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">满足法律要求</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动化贸易应收账款的评估流程，减少手动工作量，降低成本</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
